  :rejection-analysis
  ("Raw material available: 1,706 code blocks + 200 pair records + 29
    Sakura-says quotes + ~60 SLAT curriculum fields (est).
    Emit rate ~50% after: (1) BUILD-marker filter, (2) mixed-pronoun
    filter (the assistant + she/her), (3) 'sakura' identifier-remnant
    filter, (4) length caps, (5) dedupe."
   "Shortfall vs 2,500 target is fundamental — book carries less
    dialogue-shaped material than estimated. Bulk of yield is
    (heading→code-demo) pairs which cap at chapter's code-block count.")
  :status :under-target)

